WEBVTT

00:20.880 --> 00:26.860
If I was dreaming, how did I forget?

00:26.920 --> 00:30.690
It pulsed through me, frigid, shocked me

00:30.690 --> 00:32.330
Can I do, do?

00:33.000 --> 00:38.000
I want you next to me when I summon you

00:39.170 --> 00:43.000
Waiting close by, but you seem far off

00:43.010 --> 00:45.340
Na, na, na, knight

00:45.340 --> 00:48.510
The more beautiful the rose

00:48.510 --> 00:51.480
The more its thorns hurt

00:51.480 --> 00:54.750
Now that I'm strong

00:54.750 --> 00:59.750
My heart knows to protect that vow

01:00.760 --> 01:03.790
Let's meet in the dark of night

01:03.790 --> 01:06.860
Where you're waiting

01:06.860 --> 01:09.860
You'll worship the cruel Dark Queen

01:09.870 --> 01:13.030
Who's drunk with danger

01:13.040 --> 01:16.000
You shattered the glass sword

01:16.000 --> 01:18.970
You wielded without thinking

01:18.970 --> 01:21.910
Its shards glow in the night

01:21.910 --> 01:25.380
I lick your wounded fingers

01:42.430 --> 01:45.030
It's Reiri Kamura,
she comes from the upper class.

01:45.030 --> 01:47.670
She sure is early today.

01:47.670 --> 01:50.710
She must be feeling well today.

01:50.710 --> 01:53.780
Gosh, Kamura is so beautiful.

01:56.310 --> 01:58.050
They're so cruel.

01:58.050 --> 02:01.120
Leaving me to carry their bags
while they go on ahead...

02:05.920 --> 02:07.760
Wait a moment.

02:07.760 --> 02:12.060
No way, I've never seen Reiri call out
a guy like that before.

02:12.060 --> 02:14.200
What?!

02:17.630 --> 02:18.830
No way!

02:18.830 --> 02:21.770
I'm dreaming!

02:21.770 --> 02:23.940
Thank you very much.

02:23.940 --> 02:25.610
L..I'll be going now.

02:25.610 --> 02:26.850
What's your name?

02:28.040 --> 02:31.080
L..l..l..I'm in eighth grade,

02:31.080 --> 02:32.750
H..Hiro Hiyorimi!

02:33.180 --> 02:34.580
Hiro, is it?

02:34.580 --> 02:36.220
Y..Yes!

02:36.520 --> 02:39.430
Well then, Hiro, you have a nice day.

02:43.390 --> 02:45.570
A..Are you all right?

02:48.130 --> 02:49.940
I'm fine.

02:50.400 --> 02:54.070
That darn sun just got to me.

02:54.640 --> 02:57.000
Reiri, are you okay?

02:57.010 --> 02:58.840
Don't overdo it.

02:58.840 --> 03:01.080
Why did you talk to him, by the way?

03:01.940 --> 03:04.450
What was that just now?

03:04.450 --> 03:06.750
It was weird, like a shiver down my back.

03:06.750 --> 03:10.420
Damn you, Hiro!

03:10.420 --> 03:12.190
We saw everything!

03:12.190 --> 03:15.900
Why are you and Kamura so close, you jerk?!

03:42.680 --> 03:44.790
May <i>I</i> join you?

03:49.560 --> 03:51.370
O..Of course!

04:03.740 --> 04:06.970
Umm, do you want to ask me something?

04:06.980 --> 04:10.880
No, just continue your meal.

04:10.880 --> 04:12.550
O..Okay...

04:21.160 --> 04:22.970
Thank you for the meal.

04:23.830 --> 04:27.030
Hey, K..Kamura...

04:29.130 --> 04:32.310
Just call me Reiri.

04:42.640 --> 04:45.280
Hiro!

04:49.050 --> 04:50.790
I'm back!

04:50.790 --> 04:55.090
Hiro, after you put your bag away,
can you help me make dinner?

04:55.090 --> 04:56.490
Okay, sure.

04:56.490 --> 04:58.330
What's this?

04:58.330 --> 05:01.560
You seem to be in a rather good mood today.

05:01.560 --> 05:04.040
Did something happen at school?

05:04.230 --> 05:08.700
Nope, nothing. Nothing at all!

05:10.610 --> 05:13.110
Well, someone seems to be enjoying himself.

05:18.250 --> 05:21.720
Umm, well...

05:22.350 --> 05:26.520
I don't care what happened to you at school.

05:26.520 --> 05:27.920
R..Right...

05:27.920 --> 05:32.430
But no matter how happy you may be,
don't forget that you're my servant.

05:33.900 --> 05:36.430
Umm, I have to go help prepare dinner.

05:36.430 --> 05:38.240
Excuse me.

05:47.880 --> 05:50.880
Night is about to pull its veil over this town.

05:50.880 --> 05:54.520
Our time has finally come.

05:56.990 --> 05:59.630
Hiro, you have a phone call!

06:00.360 --> 06:03.590
What? Tonight?

06:03.590 --> 06:06.490
Th..That doesn't really work for me...

06:06.490 --> 06:08.030
How can I put this?

06:08.030 --> 06:12.140
There are some strange people in my house.

06:12.600 --> 06:14.370
Oh, I see.

06:14.370 --> 06:17.510
Then, is there a place where we can be alone?

06:17.940 --> 06:19.740
Oh, I know.

06:19.740 --> 06:22.340
I'll be waiting on the roof of the school.

06:22.340 --> 06:24.140
Come right away, okay?

06:24.150 --> 06:25.950
Right away, okay?

06:34.660 --> 06:36.830
W..Well, this ain't good.

06:47.340 --> 06:48.740
Hiro!

06:48.740 --> 06:51.010
Where are you going, this late at night?

06:52.140 --> 06:55.490
Right, I left something at school.

06:58.210 --> 07:00.960
Umm, I'll be right back!

07:11.860 --> 07:15.900
It's not like I'm doing anything wrong
by going to meet Reiri.

07:15.900 --> 07:20.400
But I son of feel like Hime knows
I'm up to something.

07:20.400 --> 07:21.400
Liza!

07:21.400 --> 07:22.970
No!

07:22.970 --> 07:24.970
I haven't said anything yet.

07:24.970 --> 07:26.950
Don't interrupt me during dinner!

07:28.010 --> 07:30.140
Hiro's acting strange.

07:30.150 --> 07:32.480
He's always acting strange.

07:32.480 --> 07:34.980
He's been acting strange ever since
he came home from school today.

07:35.850 --> 07:38.830
I'm sure a lot of things happen to him at school.

07:39.350 --> 07:42.620
It may be faint, but I sense something sinister.

07:42.620 --> 07:45.100
Aren't you the one acting strange now?

07:45.930 --> 07:49.100
I watched him sneak outside earlier.

07:49.860 --> 07:52.100
I want you to check up on him.

07:52.100 --> 07:53.880
Go do it yourself!

07:54.400 --> 07:57.610
If my suspicions are correct,
I mustn't leave the mansion.

07:58.710 --> 08:00.520
Oh, thank you.

08:01.780 --> 08:03.280
You leave me no choice.

08:03.280 --> 08:06.450
If you go, I'll give this to you.

08:07.350 --> 08:09.630
Wow, you've got some nerve.

08:10.050 --> 08:11.820
Just get going, already!

08:11.820 --> 08:13.650
Let me finish eating first!

08:13.660 --> 08:15.360
Then, finish eating already!

08:15.360 --> 08:16.360
Thirds, please!

08:16.360 --> 08:18.000
Coming!

08:31.210 --> 08:33.380
So, you came, Hiro.

08:35.380 --> 08:37.410
Umm, Reiri,

08:37.410 --> 08:39.410
that thing this morning and then during lunch...

08:39.410 --> 08:41.420
Why the interest in me?

08:41.420 --> 08:42.650
Why?

08:42.650 --> 08:45.690
Well, if you must know,

08:45.690 --> 08:48.930
I wanted to show you the beauty of the night.

08:50.060 --> 08:52.360
I guess that's why.

08:52.360 --> 08:53.960
R..Right...

08:53.960 --> 08:56.060
I'm not following...

08:56.060 --> 08:57.700
Come...

08:59.000 --> 09:00.640
Hiro...

09:05.270 --> 09:08.550
Hurry, come here.

09:10.350 --> 09:12.330
O..Okay...

09:14.350 --> 09:18.090
It's not like I said I'm not concerned about Hiro.

09:19.120 --> 09:21.060
I smell something...

09:21.060 --> 09:23.320
As this scent draws me closer to Hiro,

09:23.320 --> 09:26.660
the stench of those creatures grows stronger.

09:26.660 --> 09:28.130
Princess,

09:28.130 --> 09:30.700
I think your intuition was dead on this time.

09:30.700 --> 09:32.870
Hang on, Hiro.

09:41.510 --> 09:45.510
Allow me to show you a world
that you've never known.

09:45.510 --> 09:47.860
Just you wait...

09:49.750 --> 09:51.560
Hiro!

09:58.590 --> 10:00.440
Thanks for the meal.

10:04.570 --> 10:06.570
Damn, I was too late.

10:07.170 --> 10:10.440
Do you know how best to protect
yourself from a vampire?

10:10.440 --> 10:11.840
Hug;-a?

10:11.840 --> 10:13.270
It's simple.

10:13.270 --> 10:15.250
Just don't leave your house.

10:16.010 --> 10:17.380
Until they're invited,

10:17.380 --> 10:22.260
a vampire is unable to enter someone's home.

10:22.680 --> 10:23.950
Hug;-a?

10:23.950 --> 10:26.750
I'm not scared of them in the least.

10:26.750 --> 10:29.530
Plus, they have a sworn enemy:

10:29.960 --> 10:32.530
werewolves.

10:34.830 --> 10:37.730
I thought I smelled something beastly before.

10:37.730 --> 10:39.970
That was you, wasn't it?

10:39.970 --> 10:41.070
Oh, my, my-

10:41.070 --> 10:44.400
I won't forgive you for what you've done to Hiro!

10:44.410 --> 10:48.320
You ruined my date with Hiro.

10:49.110 --> 10:51.280
What are you plotting?

10:51.280 --> 10:55.320
You filthy vampires have killed hundreds,
no, thousands of my kind!

10:55.850 --> 10:57.850
I could say the same of you.

10:57.850 --> 10:59.020
Shut up!

10:59.020 --> 11:01.120
How vulgar.

11:01.120 --> 11:03.420
See, this is why I hate beasts.

11:03.420 --> 11:05.860
Go back to your cage at the zoo.

11:05.860 --> 11:07.670
Shoo, shoo!

11:10.170 --> 11:11.970
Damn you!

11:15.670 --> 11:17.400
Rushing into battle, I see.

11:17.410 --> 11:19.840
My, what an unintelligent beast.

11:19.840 --> 11:22.550
And you cowards are masters at running away!

11:24.910 --> 11:26.620
H..Hiro!

12:00.220 --> 12:02.020
Now, Hiro.

12:02.180 --> 12:03.990
Off you go.

12:05.890 --> 12:08.530
Hey... Where are you going? Hiro!

12:18.070 --> 12:19.880
Sorry, I couldn't help it...

12:21.140 --> 12:23.470
What's this? You're worried about Hiro?

12:23.470 --> 12:24.470
Beat it!

12:24.470 --> 12:26.170
What are you going to do with Hiro?!

12:26.170 --> 12:30.140
Nothing, I just want him to go home.

12:30.140 --> 12:33.750
Doesn't the Princess live there?

12:36.080 --> 12:39.690
A bat that serves me told me this.

12:39.690 --> 12:44.320
If you drink the blood of royalty,
you'll inherit incredible strength.

12:44.330 --> 12:46.810
Doesn't that sound delicious?

12:49.200 --> 12:51.600
I see, so it's Hime you're after.

12:51.600 --> 12:53.340
Precisely.

12:55.700 --> 12:57.550
Wait! Hiro!

12:59.540 --> 13:00.540
Damn it!

13:00.540 --> 13:03.440
So, do you think you can stay out of my way?

13:03.440 --> 13:05.750
Look who's talking!

13:16.860 --> 13:18.670
Who is it?

13:19.590 --> 13:21.330
Mistress,

13:21.330 --> 13:23.740
do you need anything?

13:24.330 --> 13:26.140
Oh, Sawawa.

13:26.600 --> 13:28.270
No, you are excused for the night.

13:28.270 --> 13:31.200
Then, you have an excellent night.

13:31.210 --> 13:33.770
You too, Flan, don't stay up too late.

13:33.780 --> 13:35.410
Huga.

13:38.010 --> 13:39.280
They're late.

13:39.280 --> 13:42.180
I suppose I should make some preparations.

13:42.180 --> 13:43.980
Flandre!

13:43.990 --> 13:45.620
Huga.

14:10.180 --> 14:12.480
Such an annoying beast!

14:12.480 --> 14:15.080
I don't have time to waste on you!

14:15.080 --> 14:18.220
You'd better let go before I really get angry!

14:19.090 --> 14:20.900
I dare you to try.

14:23.460 --> 14:27.070
Defeating a vampire is no simple task,

14:28.400 --> 14:30.400
but there is a way.

14:30.400 --> 14:32.040
Hug;-a?

14:58.590 --> 15:00.570
How's this?

15:02.300 --> 15:03.860
Get him, Flandre.

15:03.870 --> 15:05.230
Huga.

15:09.300 --> 15:13.150
Even after becoming a vampire,
he's still a weakling.

15:16.910 --> 15:19.550
Hiro! Baring your fangs at your master?!

15:21.980 --> 15:26.300
Seems you haven't forgotten
that you're my servant.

15:30.090 --> 15:31.990
Is that you, Liza? What's wrong?

15:31.990 --> 15:33.800
L..I'm sorry.

15:34.160 --> 15:37.000
I would have won if it was a full moon.

15:37.000 --> 15:40.370
But they have the advantage
during a crescent moon.

15:40.370 --> 15:42.180
Damn it!

15:43.910 --> 15:45.650
So, that means...

15:48.180 --> 15:51.160
Thank you kindly for inviting me in.

15:55.220 --> 15:56.620
I see.

15:56.620 --> 15:59.620
The worst possible scenario has occurred.

16:02.660 --> 16:05.160
Pleased to meet you, Princess.

16:06.890 --> 16:09.700
Are you the one who tricked Hiro?

16:09.700 --> 16:12.800
"Tricked" has such a bad ring to it.

16:12.800 --> 16:15.900
We just became friends, is all.

16:15.900 --> 16:16.900
Flandre!

16:16.900 --> 16:18.470
Huga.

16:20.470 --> 16:23.080
Huga, huga, huga!

16:25.650 --> 16:29.750
My, what a loyal servant.

16:32.190 --> 16:33.820
Come...

16:33.990 --> 16:35.630
Princess?

16:36.090 --> 16:41.300
It seems you've forgotten what happens
to vampires in the middle of the night.

16:42.330 --> 16:44.440
I haven't forgotten at all.

16:48.070 --> 16:49.940
What's that?

16:49.940 --> 16:53.540
You know those ancient tricks people
used to use won't work

16:53.540 --> 16:57.650
on us pure vampires who can even
walk around in broad daylight.

17:30.110 --> 17:34.360
Did you really think a frontal assault
would work on me?

17:41.320 --> 17:45.860
You think too little of me, Princess.

17:46.860 --> 17:48.670
Are you sure about that?

17:49.660 --> 17:54.170
My, quite aggressive, aren't we?

17:55.270 --> 17:57.200
May I ask you something?

17:57.200 --> 17:58.940
What is it?

17:58.940 --> 18:01.140
Are you still able to scatter into bats

18:01.140 --> 18:03.910
while I'm holding on to you like this?

18:03.910 --> 18:05.850
I have no need to do so.

18:05.850 --> 18:09.560
You're already right in the palm of my hands.

18:12.420 --> 18:14.230
Seems you can't.

18:14.690 --> 18:16.420
You look delicious.

18:16.420 --> 18:20.590
I shall now partake in the royal blood
that grants almighty power.

18:20.600 --> 18:24.670
Before you do that, let me give
you something interesting.

18:26.870 --> 18:30.180
Is that a white ashwood stake?

18:30.670 --> 18:36.120
Did you really expect someone of royal lineage
to not know the vampires' weakness?

18:39.150 --> 18:41.210
Flandre, do not let go of her.

18:41.220 --> 18:42.850
Huga!

18:44.420 --> 18:46.450
I don't care if you're a vampire,

18:46.450 --> 18:49.400
there's no way you'll escape the grasp
of an android like Flandre.

18:51.990 --> 18:54.300
So, what will it be?

18:59.900 --> 19:03.270
I should have expected as much from royalty.

19:03.270 --> 19:05.580
It appears I've lost.

19:06.810 --> 19:10.280
You vampires have the ability to command bats.

19:10.280 --> 19:12.090
Is that correct?

19:12.980 --> 19:15.720
And you use those bats around Sasanaki Town

19:15.720 --> 19:18.930
to keep an eye on any suspicious characters.

19:19.450 --> 19:21.360
What about it?

19:21.860 --> 19:24.360
Killing you now would be trivial.

19:24.360 --> 19:26.000
However...

19:30.300 --> 19:33.470
I may be able to use you yet.

19:34.700 --> 19:38.770
Princess, you're just wasting your time
with this agreement.

19:38.770 --> 19:42.180
We vampires will not submit to anyone.

19:42.180 --> 19:43.940
I know.

19:43.940 --> 19:46.150
If you know, then why...

19:48.550 --> 19:51.080
I'm whimsical like that.

19:51.090 --> 19:52.890
Now, begone.

19:53.150 --> 19:57.790
Just remember, you won't be pardoned
if you ever attack me again.

19:57.790 --> 19:59.430
Umm...

20:00.190 --> 20:01.530
What's the matter?

20:01.530 --> 20:03.340
This girl...

20:03.560 --> 20:05.200
Huga!

20:34.430 --> 20:39.070
So, the Royal Family possesses the power
to turn vampires back into humans.

20:42.170 --> 20:43.840
H..Hime...

20:45.270 --> 20:47.250
Isn't that swell, Hiro?

20:50.640 --> 20:52.820
What would you do without me?

21:05.590 --> 21:07.230
She's here!

21:10.730 --> 21:12.900
Kamura!

21:13.700 --> 21:15.510
Good morning.

21:16.240 --> 21:18.670
Ah, my beloved lambs.

21:18.670 --> 21:21.810
You make forcing myself to stand out here
in the sun worth the effort.

21:38.590 --> 21:42.630
Play with me at night again sometime.

21:53.110 --> 21:57.650
Reiri Kamura, she's gorgeous,
but man, is she weird.

21:58.050 --> 22:01.460
It looks like things are going to
get wild around me again.

22:03.650 --> 22:06.950
Where did we go wrong?

22:06.950 --> 22:08.800
Geez, pathetic.

22:12.990 --> 22:17.990
Get down on your knees and lick my red nails

22:18.570 --> 22:26.510
Call me queen with your entangled tongue

22:29.080 --> 22:31.850
The sun that blooms in Hell

22:31.850 --> 22:34.580
Darkness that's fallen to Paradise

22:34.580 --> 22:37.150
If you're confronted with light and despair

22:37.150 --> 22:39.790
Which one goes deeper?

22:39.790 --> 22:42.520
Roses fly from my head

22:42.520 --> 22:45.230
I'll scatter them into Nirvana

22:45.230 --> 22:47.830
Wounds that secretly pain you

22:47.830 --> 22:50.400
Blood that gushes away

22:50.460 --> 22:53.100
They both lead to the depths of my heart

22:53.100 --> 22:55.770
You've given these gorgeous gifts as tribute

22:55.770 --> 22:58.440
And yet you're still

22:58.440 --> 23:01.140
Seeking love?

23:01.140 --> 23:03.880
Tell me exactly to what extent

23:03.880 --> 23:06.550
Grown men are just foolish little boys?

23:06.550 --> 23:11.550
Get down on your knees and lick my sacred feet

23:11.820 --> 23:16.820
Call me queen in your hoarse voice

23:17.260 --> 23:22.260
The proof of your life creeps up the tower of pain

23:22.500 --> 23:25.200
Slowly making your way, you can barely breathe

23:25.200 --> 23:27.830
But if you still ask for it

23:27.840 --> 23:31.800
Your dying breath just might be

23:31.810 --> 23:40.090
The words that melt my frozen tears

23:42.420 --> 23:43.420
Huga.

23:43.420 --> 23:46.090
Huh? Who's that girl?

23:46.090 --> 23:47.900
And what about that maid?

23:48.420 --> 23:50.690
That's my sister, Sherwood,

23:50.690 --> 23:52.830
and Flandre's sister, Francesca.

23:52.830 --> 23:53.860
Huga.

23:53.860 --> 23:56.000
Your sister, Princess Sherwood.

23:56.000 --> 23:58.260
Are all princesses this selfish?

23:58.270 --> 23:59.670
Did you say something, Hiro?

23:59.670 --> 24:01.400
No, I didn't say anything!

24:01.400 --> 24:03.970
N..Next episode, "Princess Alliance"

24:03.970 --> 24:05.970
Did you just call me selfish or something?

24:05.970 --> 24:07.770
I said no such a thing!

24:07.780 --> 24:10.120
Huga, huga.
